text Some conformance errors simplify the language that authors need to learn. @17,37299,694,20
text For example, the element's attribute, despite accepting both and values in practice as synonyms, disallows the use of the value, so as to simplify tutorials and other learning aids. There would be no benefit to allowing both, but it would cause extra confusion when teaching the language. @17,37331,694,61
